<%= @invitation.invited_by&.display_name || "The owner" %> asks you to sign a logbook entry for <%= @entry.aircraft.tail_number %> (<%= fmt_date(@entry.date) %>, <%= LogbookEntry::LOG_TYPES[@entry.log_type] %> log).
<% if @invitation.message.present? %>

"<%= @invitation.message %>"
<% end %>

Review and sign it here (the link works once, until <%= fmt_date(@invitation.expires_at.to_date) %>):
<%= @url %>

You'll sign in or create an account for <%= @invitation.email %>, add your certificate, and sign with your password.
